reviews.text_strengths:
The proposed model is novel in the following ways:
A novel way to encode pairwise branch distance information in the self-attention module in the Transformer block;
A novel way to encode the hierarchical labelling by using a U-shape prediction schema while concatenating the results from both ends of the U-shape to keep consistency;
